        <h2 style="border:none; text-align:center;">ONLINE LAWYERS APPLICATION WEBSITE</h2>
        <h1>LEXELITE</h1>
        <p><strong>POWERED BY MODERN INNOVATION</strong><br>Discover a powerful legal platform built for speed, efficiency, and secure connections. Find verified attorneys, book consultations, and manage your legal needs all in one place.</p>
        <br><br><br>
        <p><strong>PREPARED BY:</strong> Saman Asif</p>
        <p><strong>PROJECT:</strong> Semester II Final E-Project</p>
        <p><strong>SUBMITTED TO:</strong> Aptech Computer Education</p>
    </div>

